column16:
Move to an array of JSON objects that include date and event type--e.g:

[ 
{ "date": "2025-10-24", "event": "opened" }, 
{ "date": "2025-10-27", "event": "ADA inspected" } 
{ "date": "2025-10-30", "event": "closed" }
] 

Event types to include:
opened, closed, inspected dates (with results)
